			</orm:ModelNote>
			<orm:ModelNote id="_D9C344D4-3650-44FD-9688-A71D5ACF9CA0">
				<orm:Text>The concept of TransactionTypeTrigger is added to document how autonomous data reporting transations are initiated.
Otherwise, it would be near impossible to generate the corresponding reports in context. 
In a model where each service would have its fine modelling performed, this would not be necessary as triggers could be found within certain properties of SystemObjects.</orm:Text>
