			<orm:ModelNote id="_6F83A568-8BF8-4732-ACFC-271558DF7D53">
				<orm:Text>Enumerations</orm:Text>
			</orm:ModelNote>
			<orm:ModelNote id="_7DBF590E-1820-4CCE-918A-D261C5256EC2">
				<orm:Text>The 2 deontic modality declarations are caused by the fact that enumerations can be used for:
- TM parameter raw-to-engineering transformation where 2 or more raw values can correspond to a single engineering value
and/or
- TC argument engineering-to-raw transformation where 2 or more engineering value can correspond to a single raw value.</orm:Text>
