			<orm:ModelNote id="_05395C30-CD7A-432A-BF46-74C4EBB8A5F8">
				<orm:Text>Compiling values of value types defined for compliance with Grammars - Compiled values represented as an Abstract Syntax Tree  of related Grammar</orm:Text>
			</orm:ModelNote>
			<orm:ModelNote id="_C8B34750-5DAE-4513-B55A-871486B06A2B">
				<orm:Text>ASN1 snippet to be included in InstructionType ASN1 definition, e.g.:
