			</orm:ModelNote>
			<orm:ModelNote id="_E8934266-6B82-4877-939E-448D9B46E2A4">
				<orm:Text>A stand-alone ACN block, which may refer to some RequiredTypes  or RequiredIntegerContants, e.g.:
FORWARD-CONTROL-DEFINITION [] {serviceType [], n3 INTEGER [], messageSubtypes [size n3]} 
FORWARD-CONTROL-DEFINITIONS [] { n2 INTEGER [], definitions [size n2] }</orm:Text>
				<orm:ReferencedBy>
					<orm:ObjectType ref="_3F02E7C2-A797-41CA-B7BF-44DDEDC667C0" />
				</orm:ReferencedBy>
			</orm:ModelNote>
			<orm:ModelNote id="_EC0F2190-1319-4B84-8720-5F1F2E5DE37F">
				<orm:Text>A stand-alone ASN1 block, which may refer to some RequiredTypes or RequiredIntegerContants, e.g.:
FORWARD-CONTROL-DEFINITION ::= SEQUENCE {serviceType SERVICE-TYPE, messageSubtypes SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNumberOfDefinitions)) OF MESSAGE-SUBTYPE}
FORWARD-CONTROL-DEFINITIONS ::= SEQUENCE {definitions SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNumberOfMessageSubtypes)) OF FORWARD-CONTROL-DEFINITION}</orm:Text>
				<orm:ReferencedBy>
					<orm:ObjectType ref="_CDBFD3F6-50F3-4CD0-88A7-CF82696B71E8" />
				</orm:ReferencedBy>
			</orm:ModelNote>
			<orm:ModelNote id="_5B6CA096-AF16-4A16-BAF1-1607C2435EA9">
				<orm:Text>These types will be generated for DOC-GEN ASN1/ACN to provide &quot;fake templating&quot;,
so that tables for Chapter 8 can be generated. They will have to be entered manually
during the tailoring phase (ASN1-GEN will not generate them; it will expect them to
be present).</orm:Text>
				<orm:ReferencedBy>
					<orm:ObjectType ref="_E37F588D-14BB-407C-8C66-FE7F5D55F2D9" />
				</orm:ReferencedBy>
			</orm:ModelNote>
			<orm:ModelNote id="_F5036072-D502-4B7C-BF9D-CDFAFCF692FA">
				<orm:Text>Parametrized means that it is &quot;deduced&quot; in Chapter 8 and parametrized within ASN1/ACN</orm:Text>
