			<orm:ModelNote id="_10FED11F-7FAF-4B02-B9E4-CB066C8B59CC">
				<orm:Text>The Application Process concept involves any application that hosts at least one subservice provider, i.e. those application processes that can be remote controlled/monitored.
This implies that e.g. SCOEs can host some application processes but the M&amp;C system itself is not an AP since only involving subservice users.</orm:Text>
				<orm:ReferencedBy>
					<orm:ObjectType ref="_3B54E742-BE6B-4946-B230-074AD1BDEEBF" />
				</orm:ReferencedBy>
