			<orm:ModelNote id="_5D4D7B81-ED82-4861-928B-FF360F4E3E32">
				<orm:Text>*Subservice requires capability type1 if and only if
that subservice is of some subservice type that defines that capability type1 that is specified with a minimum applicability constraint
or that subservice provides some capability type2 that implies that capability type1.</orm:Text>
