			<orm:ModelNote id="_04E0B88F-9472-4D20-8EB4-9104CC348E9E">
				<orm:Text>*Subservice cannot provide capability type1 if and only if
that subservice provides some capability type2 that excludes that capability type1
or that subservice provides no capability type3 that is pre-requisite for that capability type1.</orm:Text>
